    "m_ObjectId": "8186e833f999484b96b5937f4012dff1",
    "m_Title": "Dot Product Node",
    "m_Content": "The Dot Product Node returns the dot product, or scalar product, of the two input vectors A and B.\r\n\r\nThe dot product is a value equal to the magnitudes of the two vectors multiplied together and then multiplied by the cosine of the angle between them.",
