    "m_Type": "UnityEditor.ShaderGraph.StickyNoteData",
    "m_ObjectId": "a223a14d7a884ece99c691affcb949b2",
    "m_Title": "",
    "m_Content": "If you have a vector and you want to make a change to only one of the components, you can use Split to seperate the components of the vector, and then use Combine to bring them back together.  In between, you can make changes to the one or more components that need to be altered.",
