    "m_ObjectId": "a6816287e9e2462da1cf4fa8ecb0261c",
    "m_Title": "",
    "m_Content": "The Combine node can be used to create Vector 2, Vector 3, or Vector4 outputs. The type can be selected by dragging a wire from the RGBA, RGB, or RG output ports.\n\nThe RGB output only uses the inputs from R, G, and B.  The RG output only uses the inputs from R and G.",
