    "m_ObjectId": "e22f99269ed843cdb53289bd1d039e66",
    "m_Title": "",
    "m_Content": "In stylized character art, some artists like to apply a gradient to their charactger so the the area at the feet of the character is darker, and the character gets brighter toward the head.  Here's one way to achieve that using the Position node in Object space.",
